   "stem_html": "<p>The table below shows the number of chips in a game and the number of moves that can be made.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n  <thead></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"row\">Number of chips</th>\n      <td>\n        1\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        2\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        3\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        4\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"row\">Number of possible moves</th>\n      <td>\n        3\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        5\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        7\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        9\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n <br> <p>How many moves would be possible with 7 chips?</p>",
